@startuml 04-seq-consent-and-authorization-start
title Consent creation and start of the OAuth2 authorization-code flow (steps 1-5)
autonumber
actor PSU
participant "PSU browser" as Br
participant "TPP back end" as TPP
participant "Bank XS2A API" as XS2A
participant "Bank consent mgmt" as CM
participant "OIDC provider" as OIDC

PSU -> Br : select "Bank", click Connect
Br -> TPP : POST /banks/bank/connect
TPP -> XS2A : POST /v1/consents (mTLS QWAC)\naccess {accounts:[], balances:[]}, recurring, validUntil,\nTPP-Redirect-URI, PSU-IP-Address, X-Request-ID
XS2A -> XS2A : validate QWAC (AISP role), syntax, semantics
XS2A -> CM : create consent (received) + authorisation (received)
XS2A --> TPP : 201 consentId, ASPSP-SCA-Approach: REDIRECT\n_links: scaOAuth, scaStatus, self, status, confirmation
TPP -> OIDC : GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
OIDC --> TPP : metadata (authorization_endpoint, token_endpoint, jwks_uri)
TPP -> TPP : generate state + PKCE verifier,\nbind to session and consentId
TPP --> Br : 302 OIDC/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=PSDDE-BAFIN-123456\n&scope=AIS:{consentId} offline_access&state&redirect_uri\n&code_challenge&code_challenge_method=S256
Br -> OIDC : GET /authorize
OIDC -> OIDC : validate client_id, redirect_uri, PKCE
OIDC -> CM : consent {consentId} owned by client and status received?
CM --> OIDC : yes
OIDC --> Br : 302 Bank CIAM /authorize (broker)\nacr_values=urn:bank:psd2:sca, consent context
@enduml
